// TMS5200/TMC0285 (CD2501E) LPC parameter ROM, 256 x 10 bit
// Transcribed from the TMS5200NL die decap (digshadow, March 2013,
// siliconpr0n.org). Energy and pitch also match US patent 4,335,277;
// the patent's K tables are scrambled, the decap is authoritative.
// Layout: 00-0F energy(16, idx15=stop), 10-4F pitch(64),
// 50-6F K1(32), 70-8F K2(32), 90-9F K3, A0-AF K4, B0-BF K5, C0-CF K6,
// D0-DF K7 (16 each), E0-E7 K8, E8-EF K9, F0-F7 K10 (8 each), F8-FF unused.
// 10-bit two's complement.
